Five Below's operating income for fiscal 2023, the 53-week year ended February 3, 2024, was $385.6 million, versus $345.0 million in fiscal 2022 [1]. That equaled 10.8% of net sales, compared with 11.2% the prior year [1].

The filing also notes that fiscal 2023 ran from January 29, 2023 to February 3, 2024 and consisted of 53 weeks [2].